{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB節目《美食強人》明晚（26日）播出的海南雞飯主題，上演一場平民美食大逆襲！節目中四間餐廳價錢由約41港元到近400港元不等，差距極大，但最終獲得最高評級的竟不是五星級酒店的貴價貨，賽果令人驚艷。究竟是哪間平民小店能夠爆冷跑出，力壓強敵</p>\n<p>\nTVB節目《美食強人》最新一集播出的海南雞飯主題，上演一場平民美食大逆襲！節目中四間餐廳價錢由約41港元到近400港元不等，差距極大，但最終獲得最高評級的竟不是五星級酒店的貴價貨，賽果令人驚艷。究竟是哪間平民小店能夠爆冷跑出，力壓強敵？\n</p>\n<h2>珠海VS上環 海南雞飯平貴大對決</h2>\n<p>今晚播出的第六集將會揭曉「海南雞飯」主題的最終賽果，星級食評家肥媽及周奕瑋將會試食四間餐廳，包括珠海的「打破廣東傳統海南雞飯」、「西貢名物去骨海南雞飯」、位於上環的「親民價高質海南雞飯」，以及五星級酒店出品、叫價375港元（需另加一）的貴價選擇。四者價錢由35元人民幣（約41港元）起跳，價格差異巨大，但令人意外的是，獲得GBA最高評級的並非收費最貴的五星級酒店，引發評審熱議。</p>\n<h2>肥媽驚嘆賽果 質疑評審標準太手緊</h2>\n<p>面對出人意表的賽果，評審團亦意見紛紜。對於叫價接近400港元的海南雞飯，黃永幟（幟哥）、胡孟青及肥媽三人的看法各有不同，火花四濺。而當一間備受好評、連湯都於中午12點就賣光的食店，最終竟未能得到GBA評級時，連肥媽都忍不住大感惋惜，更為店家抱不平，感嘆各人評分太手緊：「所有食過嘅都讚，湯又12點賣晒，咁都攞唔到GBA？」</p>\n<h2>網民熱議價錢迷思：貴唔一定好食</h2>\n<p>節目預告一出，立即引發網民熱烈討論，不少人都對平民美食能挑戰酒店級出品表示期待，並對評審的標準議論紛紛。有網民留言直指價錢與味道未必成正比，認為這次對決相當有睇頭。<br/>\n「400蚊食海南雞飯？鑲金咩？」<br/>\n「支持平民美食！貴唔一定好食！」<br/>\n「其實酒店級用料同心機係唔同嘅，一分錢一分貨。」<br/>\n「肥媽講得啱，賣晒都冇獎，個標準好怪。」<br>\n「好想知邊間平民店咁勁！求開名！」</br></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/02_20330991216add7ef208e1e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/02_20330991216add7ef208e1e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/04_8467178686add7efa4db51.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/04_8467178686add7efa4db51.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/05_18731853066add7efe17c44.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/05_18731853066add7efe17c44.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/06_14037959176add7f0191dd5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/06_14037959176add7f0191dd5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/07_18759142136add7f05cbff3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/07_18759142136add7f05cbff3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_8473116196add7f09dcd68.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_8473116196add7f09dcd68.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_20111609646add7f0d6711b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_20111609646add7f0d6711b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_10278797386add7f1138d94.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_10278797386add7f1138d94.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_4683289496add7f14a5fc5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_4683289496add7f14a5fc5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/14_20029621716add7f1eb6485.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/14_20029621716add7f1eb6485.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:41:07.991151+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1146,"images":10,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T14:00:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T14:59:01.385306+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:38:28.190583+00:00","content_hash":"f856dc50e2cdb217783898bf9c315326f4a25a5ffd4a17b38fb9088500a87275","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}